{"2332120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One Card One Shot - Mafia", "steam_appid": 2332120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Game Development</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/58eac4def195286e1060fd72a1070f8a.avif?t=1773830765\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CARDS ON THE TABLE. FINGER ON THE TRIGGER</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sharp fusion of <strong>tactical deckbuilding</strong> with <strong>first-person precision shooting</strong>. Flip cards, create synergies, and finish the contract with a single shot — <strong>every bullet counts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/e1de229d67e99c104010e0f357689bd3.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/e1de229d67e99c104010e0f357689bd3.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/e1de229d67e99c104010e0f357689bd3.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WHY YOU’LL LOVE IT!</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical “decide and shoot” action</strong> — play your cards, read the field, and finish in FPS at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic transitions between mechanics</strong> — start in a top-down shooter, switch to FPS, or vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surprise in every mission</strong> — new enemies, patterns, and mechanics keep discovery constant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful mafia bosses</strong> — each territory has its own rules, traps, and dangerous enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite map &amp; progression</strong> — choose routes between Enemies, Mid-Boss, Events, Side Jobs, and Safehouse; push forward toward the Big Boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited ammo</strong> — managing bullets is part of the strategy (and the tension).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secondary weapons</strong> — finish targets in different ways and save ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, replayable runs</strong> — perfect for “just one more” (average 8–15 min).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/e8961032f21e8200a19f4e511f3390eb.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/e8961032f21e8200a19f4e511f3390eb.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/e8961032f21e8200a19f4e511f3390eb.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>EXPLORING THE GAME</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a bounty hunter in the mafia underworld. With a lethal deck and a trusty rifle, every contract becomes a battle of nerves: chain effects, create openings, and pull the trigger when everything is in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your hunt deck before each mission. Cards <strong>are activated at the start</strong> and shape the battlefield: <strong>body armor, extra ammo, protection</strong>, and other perks that pave the way for the perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/a0af459a765cf021de124b559de347ad.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/a0af459a765cf021de124b559de347ad.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/a0af459a765cf021de124b559de347ad.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MAFIA BOSSES</strong></u><br>Bosses control their own territories. Read their patterns and pull off the final hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/8547bd8a2f495aa53cfcf2b3cc70c03e.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/8547bd8a2f495aa53cfcf2b3cc70c03e.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/8547bd8a2f495aa53cfcf2b3cc70c03e.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SECONDARY WEAPONS</strong></u><br>Versatile, fast, economical, and decisive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/7dcd15cd72c4f25203f3cf8df33b9a28.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/7dcd15cd72c4f25203f3cf8df33b9a28.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/7dcd15cd72c4f25203f3cf8df33b9a28.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PROGRESSION &amp; MAPS</strong></u><br>Plot routes between Enemies, Mid-Boss, Events, Side Jobs, and Safehouse; each region culminates in a Boss — mastering territories leads to the Big Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/1ee59d9929c6ff240d727a29d9699821.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/1ee59d9929c6ff240d727a29d9699821.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/1ee59d9929c6ff240d727a29d9699821.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>COMMUNITY</u></strong><br>Want to help development, join playtests, and grab promos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/d20a1a613c054d517370cc133d421395.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CARDS ON THE TABLE. FINGER ON THE TRIGGER</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sharp fusion of <strong>tactical deckbuilding</strong> with <strong>first-person precision shooting</strong>. Flip cards, create synergies, and finish the contract with a single shot — <strong>every bullet counts</strong