h\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/8547bd8a2f495aa53cfcf2b3cc70c03e.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/8547bd8a2f495aa53cfcf2b3cc70c03e.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/8547bd8a2f495aa53cfcf2b3cc70c03e.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SECONDARY WEAPONS</strong></u><br>Versatile, fast, economical, and decisive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/7dcd15cd72c4f25203f3cf8df33b9a28.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/7dcd15cd72c4f25203f3cf8df33b9a28.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/7dcd15cd72c4f25203f3cf8df33b9a28.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PROGRESSION &amp; MAPS</strong></u><br>Plot routes between Enemies, Mid-Boss, Events, Side Jobs, and Safehouse; each region culminates in a Boss — mastering territories leads to the Big Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/1ee59d9929c6ff240d727a29d9699821.poster.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/1ee59d9929c6ff240d727a29d9699821.webm?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/1ee59d9929c6ff240d727a29d9699821.mp4?t=1773830765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>COMMUNITY</u></strong><br>Want to help development, join playtests, and grab promos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/extras/d20a1a613c054d517370cc133d421395.avif?t=1773830765\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore the mafia underworld in the first Sniper Card Game. Combine card strategy, pinpoint aim, and split-second choices in intense, surprise-packed missions: each one brings new enemies, cards, and mechanics to overcome — and always leaves you asking: what’s coming next?", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Russian, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/a887e118f00d2bff7404e3c9666ecb891b9abfe1/header.jpg?t=1773830765", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/e6625cf65406e83cfac9869606ad34e0a9ee80c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773830765", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332120/e6625cf65406e83cfac9869606ad34e0a9ee80c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773830765", "website": "https://www.yawstudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 64 bits Pr